### 1. Login como admin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. Endpoint protegido SIN token (debe dar 401/403)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/me

